    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/b98e68329fc71cfb61aa49ded42c25df.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Qisah Tomang: Cycle Ends is a story-rich RPG. The story is set in an East Asia inspired fantasy world. Fight off the Demon Tomang and its minion and discover the truth behind the Cycle of Hatred and put an end to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive classic turn based RPG set in east Asia inspired fantasy theme. Using charge-turn based system, triangle advantage and row formation battle system to add depth to the battle. Spice up with the addition of War mode where you control an army in an  all-out war<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/0e1f49442aef18e61b78589a42e8f946.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> as your traverse dungeon with each character bringing their own traversal tools.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/710be710d02152d2a9c91cfaa15cc1b7.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>War mode</strong> where you command armies and brigades to win colossal battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5ea02d26d89d10cf8ff340ba4bc765af.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash <strong>combination attacks</strong> from two or more characters to change the tide of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/d94ead3275f642cfdc73a314b6e54fa3.webp?t=1735239597\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic pixel art will accompany your adventure throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/978db570916e60461013da99067cf849.webp?t=1735239597\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions through the game will influence the outcome of the game, choose carefully or explore each decision and route to find out what is at the end of the road! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/d44ed7ae51fb19a3d00d9eaef1819aae.avif?t=1735239597\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For centuries An immortal demon called Tomang terrorize on the United Golden Dragon Empire. due to his immortality, each time he was slain he came back stronger leading to a cycle of terror and despair for the people  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, on one of the cycle while they were preparing for him, Tomang doesn\u2019t appear. Believing the demon is gone, the people of the Empire celebrated their triumph and began to enjoy their peaceful life once more. However, the disappearance of Tomang resulted in the weakening of the Empire, with no common enemy to fight corruption and infighting run rampant in the empire. Little did they know a rising threat from the shadows, preparing the destruction of the empire.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the unlikely ragtag group of people on their quest to save the empire and uncover the secret behind The Cycle of Hatred. Will they succeed or is it too late to save the empire and its people? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/b98e68329fc71cfb61aa49ded42c25df.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Qisah Tomang: Cycle Ends is a story-rich RPG. The story is set in an East Asia inspired fantasy world. Fight off the Demon Tomang and its minion and discover the truth behind the Cycle of Hatred and put an end to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/7789cbb5a296a12e9f85954f48bd86b5.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive classic turn based RPG set in east Asia inspired fantasy theme. Using charge-turn based system, triangle advantage and row formation battle system to add depth to the battle. Spice up with the addition of War mode where you control an army in an  all-out war<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/0e1f49442aef18e61b78589a42e8f946.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/93661f0491e1941130fa6e29551a86f4.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> as your traverse dungeon with each character bringing their own traversal tools.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/710be710d02152d2a9c91cfaa15cc1b7.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/a3a06cd9f37cf0055df8a67702ee68f9.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>War mode</strong> where you command armies and brigades to win colossal battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5ea02d26d89d10cf8ff340ba4bc765af.avif?t=1735239597\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/5071429db159e29cea4c0f9989448ae7.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash <strong>combination attacks</strong> from two or more characters to change the tide of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/d94ead3275f642cfdc73a314b6e54fa3.webp?t=1735239597\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/fe90cd95a0bf7a25bd3005613b95c3dd.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic pixel art will accompany your adventure throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/978db570916e60461013da99067cf849.webp?t=1735239597\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.poster.avif?t=1735239597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.webm?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/eca2dcf41f8b68fadb2f4298dec15afc.mp4?t=1735239597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions through the game will influence the outcome of the game, choose carefully or explore each decision and route to find out what is at the end of the road! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227810/extras/d44ed7ae51fb19a3d00d9eaef1819aae.avif?t=1735239597\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For centuries An immortal demon called Tomang terrorize on the United Golden Dragon Empire. due to his immortality, each time he was slain he came back stronger leading to a cycle of terror and despair for the people  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, on one of the cycle while they were preparing for him, Tomang doesn\u2019t appear. Believing the demon is gone, the people of the Empire celebrated their triumph and began to enjoy their peaceful life once more. However, the disappearance of Tomang resulted in the weakening of the Empire, with no common enemy to fight corruption and infighting run rampant in the empire. Little did they know a rising threat from the shadows, preparing the destruction of the empire.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the unlikely ragtag group of people on their quest to save the empire and uncover the secret behind The Cycle of Hatred. Will they succeed or is it too late to save the empire and its people? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
